#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059500 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb13e9d9-19f0-5f39-b9f8-e6e2f8fac433" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Coefficient Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/id #uuid "b2196eb1-6691-549b-950a-a9bab6863a70" :question/math-academy-id "e-4683" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=1 \\\\ 2y=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-2y=1 \\\\ 0x+2y=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & -2 \\\n\t\t0 & 2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059501 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/id #uuid "b5967dd6-bdf9-5cd0-9639-ec2816d04256" :question/math-academy-id "e-4684" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}y+x-5-3z=0 \\\\ z=y+7x \\\\ y+3-2z=1-2x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+y-3z=5 \\\\ -7x-y+z=0 \\\\ 2x+y-2z=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3 \\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1 \\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -7 & -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 & -2\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059502 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "05942b5f-c165-59c6-8b67-24bc8dd40cca" :question/math-academy-id "e-4685" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5 & -4 & -12 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x-4y=-12 \\\\ 3x+y=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059503 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/id #uuid "161a4327-2356-5779-92a6-8495cfffefb9" :question/math-academy-id "e-4686" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{c}{2}=a \\\\ 5+3b-a=4c \\\\ d=1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-a+0b+\\frac{1}{2}c+0d=0 \\\\ -a+3b-4c+0d=-5 \\\\ 0a+0b+0c+d=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059894 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "83e807b6-d6f8-53f2-b115-1555aaea5385" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056085} {:answer/id #uuid "ae54720c-02af-5ca7-b71b-3c75b5a90136" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056086} {:answer/id #uuid "1ab34e8e-21db-58cb-8dc4-3e389fe78a23" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056087} {:answer/id #uuid "41e06a81-0005-590b-aa27-1ec77ffb049c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056088} {:answer/id #uuid "430d1419-4e3f-5ff1-b941-7460daceb94d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056089}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "430d1419-4e3f-5ff1-b941-7460daceb94d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056089} :answer-field/id #uuid "e858ca63-042d-53ac-84e0-bf30a158feac" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056084}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "fc7baee7-708d-5083-9b3d-6efab5143302" :question/math-academy-id "q-1051" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+0y+z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298991 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "609e9eb0-c713-524d-91b8-e6329930232a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298993} {:answer/id #uuid "2dde8f4a-6b1c-5197-b3c0-096652f5685a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298994} {:answer/id #uuid "3e8b1ff2-6953-5222-89aa-ea71639b6d12" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298995} {:answer/id #uuid "bccba62a-06e3-5777-8e21-c47b88df2c63" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298996} {:answer/id #uuid "85b13f75-d0b6-5512-909f-db07b8e04e35" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298997}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "85b13f75-d0b6-5512-909f-db07b8e04e35" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298997} :answer-field/id #uuid "991f7a96-c7c6-5249-a02f-1e94a4ef4eee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298992}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "66cf2bed-9200-5455-a5fd-8abe57a055ac" :question/math-academy-id "q-1052" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-5=3y \\\\ 6+y=4x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-3y=5 \\\\ -4x+y=-6\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299005 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cce466f8-0de5-56df-889f-43