side, and every variable has a coefficient: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 0{x}_{1}+0{x}_{2}-11{x}_{3}=12\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060321 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb13e9d9-19f0-5f39-b9f8-e6e2f8fac433" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Coefficient Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "89777a9b-90ba-5568-ac73-8308fbb0fb87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058910} {:answer/id #uuid "a604d9e5-c0d7-5cbf-aec5-e15027284e66" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058911} {:answer/id #uuid "0b18873b-b901-59b3-9ad7-d38d3bcd0eac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058912} {:answer/id #uuid "34ce452f-0612-5206-a18e-4a1b424d2927" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058913} {:answer/id #uuid "5b91912f-4424-528e-b6a4-4fe4e9873e06" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058914}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5b91912f-4424-528e-b6a4-4fe4e9873e06" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058914} :answer-field/id #uuid "788ed7d4-f0ae-5a49-ba14-46c4d95d00a7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058909}] :question/id #uuid "eef99db5-e18d-595a-8174-36050f6d2ac1" :question/math-academy-id "q-71713" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n${-x + y = 2; x - y =-2$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299089 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c5b80452-12b9-5ea6-89d8-e660225e9277" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299091} {:answer/id #uuid "e33c94ee-d059-5f9f-b841-d2d8cb9947c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299092} {:answer/id #uuid "a97786ff-7ca3-542d-9ad3-5612753e7c48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299093} {:answer/id #uuid "f3efe0ef-e145-5648-a1ca-631fbb55b726" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299094} {:answer/id #uuid "a2e5a4cf-c626-571e-9739-342e8312b273" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299095}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a97786ff-7ca3-542d-9ad3-5612753e7c48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299093} :answer-field/id #uuid "c0aaedcf-8f9e-55a6-ad72-25a43e5ddd91" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299090}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "671bb0ea-172d-5bcd-9af7-fde2cdb49f9b" :question/math-academy-id "q-71722" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-3=2y \\\\ 1+y=-2x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=3 \\\\ 2x+y=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299096 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fd07f452-0633-5460-9442-d326bf925eb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ 2x-3y=-18\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299098} {:answer/id #uuid "35795abf-e7a2-5919-b638-5fc6256411e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}-5x-y=10 \\\\ -3x-2y=-5\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299099} {:answer/id #uuid "10e6f7b9-0cdd-5b87-a45d-70e89c39842b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=1 \\\\ -2x-3y=-5\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299100} {:answer/id #uuid "a9bdcbbf-378b-5a67-9cb2-d662542dd25d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299101} {:answer/id #uuid "41578edf-3c23-5b5f-982a-492b8f89b9f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ 2x-3y=-16\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299102}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a9bdcbbf-378b-5a67-9cb2-d662542dd25d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299101} :answer-field/id #uuid "36b93888-4be1-504b-b8c2-f8ea03f231ce" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299097}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fccffcb6-cabb-5be9-bcba-30754f9d0e4e" :question/math-academy-id "q-71728" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & 10 \\\\ -2 & -3 & -15\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299103 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e35c8f0c-a7f5-5565-922b-fb17c30a5cd2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299105} {:answer/id #uuid "651fee39-5130-508b-a1e9-34741f00649b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299106} {:answer/id #uuid "96bd09a1-b4b0-57fc-9cab-85c2467937ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299107} {:answer/id #uuid "0a3f3600-9316-5dc5-99a9-de44153fb00c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299108} {:answer/id #uuid "697efabd-62d8-528d-8ac0-420ee13fb911" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299109}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "697efabd-62d8-528d-8ac0-420ee13fb911" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299109} :answer-field/id #uuid "b3249609-b27f-5fe9-bb12-dc6539b4d474" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299104}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "39cd7b44-484f-5137-a0a3-95f76a9d1baa" :question/math-academy-id "q-71733" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=-5 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}=-3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}]}
